,"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game/7758caa8d9578f19780349e7b4e4115ef831fd7a/examples/journey-to-the-west/screenshots/battle.jpg","text","mediaReviewed","截图来源核查","value","2026-10-20","language","en","image","gameplay","The creator’s published battle screenshot, retaining the original painted scene and game interface.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/novel-journey-to-west.webp","alt","A command battle at Jilei Mountain, with Wukong’s party, the Bull Demon King’s side, turn order and a command panel.","https://github.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game/blob/7758caa8d9578f19780349e7b4e4115ef831fd7a/examples/journey-to-the-west/screenshots/battle.jpg","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型",[93],"其他 / 未指定代理","创作者开发记录",[98],"evidence","section",{"_62":99,"_25":100,"_101":102},"阅读作者的流程与案例记录","https://github.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game#play-online","note","The creator links the game to the NovelToGame workflow and its adaptation workspace. Published QA is author evidence, not a GameMap reproduction.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[107],{"_62":108,"_25":109,"_101":110},"查看完整改编资料与游戏","https://github.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game/tree/main/examples/journey-to-the-west","Includes the static game, painted scene and character assets, design workspace and browser QA. No generation API is required to play the committed build. Repository MIT terms and the source/asset ledgers should be read together.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[116],{"_62":117,"_25":118,"_101":119},"Play Three Borrowings of the Banana Fan","https://xiyouji.vibecoco.ai/","Chinese-language browser prototype. Click to walk, interact with marked NPCs and choose battle commands. The author records a desktop completion path; narrow-screen play has separate limitations.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","build log","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[127],{"_62":128,"_25":109,"_101":-7},"查看改编工作资料","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[133,134,135,136],"Play the village and use the quest tracker to reach an NPC or a battle.","Compare the novel chapter references with the selected fan, transformation and five-element mechanics.","Read the design, art and QA files to distinguish implemented systems from deliberately omitted multiplayer features.","To run locally, serve examples/journey-to-the-west/build/app with python3 -m http.server 5173; inspect the JavaScript battle implementation before changing a rule.","AI 工作流与开发背景","Zenstory 将该游戏作为 NovelToGame 代理工作流的产物发布，提供原著分析、被淘汰的概念、玩法与美术设计、生成美术、完整实现及 QA 记录。案例没有明确某一个编码客户端，不能从工具支持列表推断所有客户端都参与了制作。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","引擎","Custom Canvas 2D · JavaScript · DOM UI","engine","lead","2d",[133,134,135,136],{"_62":166,"_25":109,"_17":167},{"_62":117,"_25":118,"_17":112,"_101":119},{"_62":163,"_25":109,"_101":110,"_164":165},{"_62":162,"_25":100,"_101":102},"ai-assisted","resourceIds",[],"Read the creator’s workflow and example record","Open the complete adaptation and game","scope","complete-project","Read the adaptation workspace","build-log",{"_169":170},"documents",{"_74":171,"_35":172},[174,178,179,180,177,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,176,213,175,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231],[173,174,175,176,177],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","a